Package: LargescAB
Type: Package
Title: Large-scale extension of scAB for integrating single-cell and bulk
        RNA-seq data with phenotype information.
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Qinran Zhang
Maintainer: Qinran Zhang<qr_zhang@whu.edu.cn>
Description: Local development fork of scAB focused on scalable preprocessing,
    HDF5-backed fitting, large-data K and alpha selection, and reproducible
    project-level execution for large single-cell datasets.
